      "widgets_values": [
        "hole_mask (preview, right) = WHITE where the render is real geometry, BLACK where the frame was torn open and had to be closed.\n\nUse it to judge how far you can push movement_scale: once the black areas get big, no fill mode will save you -- that is when you go back to the WAN pipeline (workflows/final/1_camera_plot_flythrough.json), which hallucinates the missing content instead of extrapolating it.\n\nIn 'cut' mode this mask IS an inpainting mask you can feed to any diffusion inpaint node."
      ]
    },
